{
  "metadata": {
    "note": "Exercises the Reconciler._any_managed_for fix: dropping timezone/locales/pacman/systemd from the config after they were applied must (a) plan silently for the first three and release their manifest ownership, (b) plan a DISABLE for the systemd unit the manifest still owns, and (c) survive a rollback back to the full config. Drive with scripts/vmtest/guest-block-removal.sh.",
    "systemd_unit": "systemd-timesyncd.service is enabled here specifically because dasik would not otherwise enable it (no expand toggle derives it), so its enablement can only come from this declared `systemd` block — the guest script's DISABLE assertion is unambiguous."
  },
